WHAT IS DERIVED, AND FROM WHAT
------------------------------

engine/glm53.c
    A fork of colibri.c (the GLM-5.2 / glm_moe_dsa engine). The great majority
    of this file is upstream code: expert streaming, the LRU/pin tiers, the
    sigmoid + noaux_tc router, MLA attention, the MTP head, quantization
    kernels, the serve loop. See the file header for what was added.

    Within it, two blocks are ports rather than original work:

      kda_forward()   ported from colibri's own c/kimi_k3.c:1167 (Kimi Delta
                      Attention). Every tensor name and shape matched already;
                      the only change is GLM-5.3's low-rank output gate
                      (g_a_proj @ g_b_proj) replacing Kimi's dense g_proj.

      mHC             dsv4_mhc.h is included VERBATIM from colibri's
                      DeepSeek-V4 engine. GLM-5.3's hyper-connections are
                      DeepSeek-V4's unchanged -- llama.cpp reached the same
                      conclusion independently, subclassing
                      DeepseekV4HyperConnection with a bare `pass`.

engine/glm53_mhc.h
    New. Thin glue over dsv4_mhc.h pinning the three constants GLM-5.3 needs
    (post scale 2.0, both epsilons = hc_eps) plus the stream seed/collapse.

converter/*.patch, engine/0003-Makefile-glm53-targets.patch
    Patches against the upstream files named in each patch header.


WHAT IS ORIGINAL
----------------

  * The DSA k-pool indexer implementation in glm53.c. Written from the
    algorithm described in llama.cpp PR #27752 (ggml-org/llama.cpp), which is
    unmerged, text-only, and whose author states it is "not numerically
    validated" and was "never tested on real weights". No code was copied from
    it; the pooled-key formulation is the paper's, the C implementation is not.
  * The hybrid KDA/DSA layer dispatch and the [S, hc_mult, D] residual plumbing.
  * The validation harness in validation/ and the fixtures beside it.
  * The GLM-5.3 family descriptor and planner geometry in family_registry.py.


THIRD-PARTY REFERENCES USED AS ORACLES (not vendored)
-----------------------------------------------------

  * transformers' DeepseekV4HyperConnection -- oracle for mHC.
  * transformers' GlmMoeDsaAttention -- oracle for MLA.
  * colibri's c/tools/k3_ref.py -- basis for the KDA numpy reference.

  These are imported at test time from an installed transformers / from the
  upstream colibri checkout. No third-party source is redistributed here.


MODEL WEIGHTS
-------------

No weights are distributed in this repository. GLM-5.3-Flash is published by
Z.AI at https://huggingface.co/zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash under the MIT License.
scripts/download_glm53.py fetches it; scripts/convert_glm53.sh converts it.
